resentation do you  any final comments I just want to thank  everybody and if you have any questions  further to this please contact me at my  email that should be on the last slide  of the presentation well thank you once  again I would also like to thank our  sponsor two-room o BCT for making  today's educational webcast possible  this webinar has been approved for  continuing educational credits please  click on the CD button at the bottom  left corner and follow the process to  receive your credits and before we go I  want to let everyone know that today's  webcast will be available for on-demand  viewing through November 31st 2017  you'll receive an email from lab roots  letting you know when this webcast will  be available for replay please share  that announcement with your colleagues  who may have missed today's live event  that's all for now thank you for joining  us and we hope to see you again soon  goodbye
 

